Firmware binaries
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Firmware images built from this repository statically link wolfSSL
(GPL-2.0-or-later) and LGPL-2.1 libraries (the Arduino-ESP32 core and
arduinoWebSockets). A distributed firmware binary is therefore a combined work
that must be distributed under the terms of the GNU General Public License,
version 3, together with the complete corresponding source code (this
repository at the matching commit, with its submodules, and the build
instructions in README.md). See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

